    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "So I say \"nee\" and \"nock\"?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Yes! Write the K, but don't say the K. \"Knee\" sounds just like \"nee\".",
      "board": {
